## Responsive Design

The design system supports responsive design through mobile-first approach.

### Breakpoints

```scss
$eduxa-breakpoint-sm: 640px;
$eduxa-breakpoint-md: 768px;
$eduxa-breakpoint-lg: 1024px;
$eduxa-breakpoint-xl: 1280px;
$eduxa-breakpoint-2xl: 1536px;
```

### Responsive Utility Classes

```html
<!-- Hide on mobile, show on tablet and up -->
<div class="hidden md:block">Desktop only</div>

<!-- Show on mobile, hide on tablet and up -->
<div class="block md:hidden">Mobile only</div>

<!-- Responsive spacing -->
<div class="p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8">Responsive padding</div>

<!-- Responsive font size -->
<p class="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg">Responsive text</p>
```

### Responsive Grid

```css
.responsive-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: var(--eduxa-spacing-4);
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .responsive-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .responsive-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
}
```

