## Migration Guide

### Migrating from Custom CSS

1. **Replace hardcoded values with design tokens**

```css
/* Before */
padding: 16px;
background-color: #6366f1;

/* After */
padding: var(--eduxa-spacing-4);
background-color: var(--eduxa-primary);
```

2. **Replace custom components with design system components**

```vue
<!-- Before -->
<div class="my-button">Click me</div>

<!-- After -->
<Button variant="primary">Click me</Button>
```

3. **Use utility classes for common patterns**

```html
<!-- Before -->
<div class="flex-container">
  <div class="item">Item 1</div>
  <div class="item">Item 2</div>
</div>

<!-- After -->
<div class="flex gap-4">
  <div>Item 1</div>
  <div>Item 2</div>
</div>
```

